                  "location": {
                    "offset": 0,
                    "length": 0,
                    "line": 0,
                    "column": 0
                  },
                  "content": "Analytics \u0026 referrers: client-side redirects (meta-refresh or JS) typically look like an extra page view in analytics and may not preserve referrer headers the same way as server-side 3xx redirects. If accurate analytics or referrer delivery is critical, prefer server-side redirects when SameSite/cookie configuration allows it."
                }
              ]
            },
