                    "length": 0,
                    "line": 0,
                    "column": 0
                  },
                  "content": "CSP/security: There are discussions being had about allowing CSP to control the user of meta-refresh. This functionality might break for websites with strict CSP if that is implemented. Also note that if you are enabling client side redirect tactics you should evaluate all forms of XSRF and XSS protections."
